# PR / review checklist

## Author (before opening PR)

- [ ] Intent / issue linked; acceptance criteria still accurate
- [ ] `npm test` and `npm run lint` pass locally
- [ ] Docs updated if endpoints, env vars, deploy, or failure modes changed
- [ ] No secrets committed; no sensitive data in logs

## Reviewer

- [ ] Change matches intent and scope (watch **non-goals**)
- [ ] Correctness and edge cases; error handling appropriate
- [ ] Security: authz, input validation, dependency risk
- [ ] Operability: migrations safe, rollback plausible, metrics/alerts considered

## If not ready to merge

Use **Quick refine**: update intent / criteria, then re-run the cycle—avoid rubber-stamping partial fixes without updated acceptance tests.
